'''Warriors of Justice''' (正義の戦士, ''Seigi no Senshi'', '''Warrior of Justice''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Recharge UP (L): Cat Cannon will charge 20 seconds faster.

